WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.000
Start with the rule the
whole profile enforces.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.396
A partner account gets access
because a sponsor asked,

3
00:00:06.396 --> 00:00:11.225
an approver agreed and a date was set,
never because it exists or synchronized.

4
00:00:11.225 --> 00:00:13.678
The partner is authoritative
for the person's

5
00:00:13.678 --> 00:00:15.938
affiliation and the credential it issues.

6
00:00:15.938 --> 00:00:20.444
The agency is authoritative for
federation trust, eligibility,

7
00:00:20.444 --> 00:00:24.950
authorization, monitoring, review,
suspension and termination.

8
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.419
So engineering has four things
to prove for every partner:

9
00:00:28.419 --> 00:00:30.949
that trust is scoped
to that partner alone,

10
00:00:30.949 --> 00:00:34.779
that every account traces to an
approved request with an expiry,

11
00:00:34.779 --> 00:00:39.621
that every partner account is a guest
unless an exception record says otherwise,

12
00:00:39.621 --> 00:00:43.813
and that access really ends at the
last assignment and at partner exit.

13
00:00:43.813 --> 00:00:45.700
The rest of this deck is how.
